   "copyCode": "<section class=\"pt-12 lg:pt-20 xl:pt-24 pb-10 md:pb-14 lg:pb-20 xl:pb-24\" id=\"reviews\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"max-w-[734px] mx-auto text-center mb-10 lg:mb-16\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 text-base text-primary bg-ss-blue-200/60 border-l-2 border-primary backdrop:blur-md uppercase\">Testimonials</span>\n\t\t\t<h2>Trusted by Homeowners and Businesses Alike</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>Hear from our satisfied clients about their experiences with Salcido's Concrete Work and the exceptional results we deliver.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"swiper testimonials\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide h-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-6 border bg-white border-ss-dark/[0.12] shadow-[0px_6px_24px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] rounded-lg relative before:absolute before:bottom-0 before:right-0 before:w-9/12 before:h-[5px] before:bg-primary before:rounded-br-lg before:skew-x-[-40deg] overflow-hidden h-full\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex mb-4 justify-between\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"[&_h3]:font-semibold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"h5 mb-2\">Frank</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-primary mb-2 inline-block text-sm\">Concrete Driveway</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"flex gap-1 text-ss-yellow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[53px] text-ss-gray-300\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-quote\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We had Salcedos remove and replace two sections of our concrete driveway. They completed the job in one day, including a complete clean-up and haul-off. The work was excellent, and their prices were very competitive. These guys are great. I highly recommend them and will definitely do more business with them in the future.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide h-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-6 border bg-white border-ss-dark/[0.12] shadow-[0px_6px_24px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] rounded-lg relative before:absolute before:bottom-0 before:right-0 before:w-9/12 before:h-[5px] before:bg-primary before:rounded-br-lg before:skew-x-[-40deg] overflow-hidden h-full\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex mb-4 justify-between\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"[&_h3]:font-semibold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"h5 mb-2\">Ron Williams</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-primary mb-2 inline-block text-sm\">Concrete Driveway</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"flex gap-1 text-ss-yellow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[53px] text-ss-gray-300\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-quote\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lucia Salcido just finished pouring two foundations for me today. One for a patio extension and another for a storage shed. He and his crew did a great job. As a retired contractor i know what l am talking about. Timley, precise, has all his own equipment for saw cutting, concrete buggy and clean. He also runs a separate concrete delivery business and has two trucks of his own. I will be passing his name around to my friends!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide h-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-6 border bg-white border-ss-dark/[0.12] shadow-[0px_6px_24px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] rounded-lg relative before:absolute before:bottom-0 before:right-0 before:w-9/12 before:h-[5px] before:bg-primary before:rounded-br-lg before:skew-x-[-40deg] overflow-hidden h-full\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex mb-4 justify-between\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"[&_h3]:font-semibold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"h5 mb-2\">Albert Estes</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-primary mb-2 inline-block text-sm\">Concrete Driveway</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"flex gap-1 text-ss-yellow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[53px] text-ss-gray-300\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-quote\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Jose and his crew did an amazing job creating a new patio at my daughter’s house. It was a surprise and they were great at working within my limited timeframe. My bid was for a 12 x 25 patio and once Jose got there that morning he recommended a 13 x 25 patio. I asked him how much more would that be, he thought then said “same price”, this was amazing! If you’re looking for honesty and quality this is your company!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide h-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-6 border bg-white border-ss-dark/[0.12] shadow-[0px_6px_24px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] rounded-lg relative before:absolute before:bottom-0 before:right-0 before:w-9/12 before:h-[5px] before:bg-primary before:rounded-br-lg before:skew-x-[-40deg] overflow-hidden h-full\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex mb-4 justify-between\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"[&_h3]:font-semibold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"h5 mb-2\">Moore Karen</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-primary mb-2 inline-block text-sm\">Concrete Driveway</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"flex gap-1 text-ss-yellow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[53px] text-ss-gray-300\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-quote\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The service was excellent. They came out the day after calling to give a quote. They did the job the following week in just one day. The old patio was taken out with a new larger patio. They do excellent work, hardworking and professional.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pagination [&_.swiper-button-disabled]:pointer-events-auto [&_.swiper-button-disabled]:cursor-not-allowed\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-button-prev\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-button-next\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>"
