   "copyCode": "<section class=\"pt-12 pb-28 lg:py-40 bg-ss-gray/60\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[788px] mx-auto text-center mb-6 lg:mb-10\">\n      <h2>What Our Clients <span>Are Saying</span></h2>\n      <div class=\"max-w-[600px] mx-auto\">\n        <p>Discover how our counseling services have helped others achieve emotional well-being and personal growth.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"container max-w-[1376px]\">\n    <div class=\"sm:px-12 relative testimonial-holder pb-10 lg:pb-20\">\n      <div class=\"swiper testimonialSlider overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"swiper-slide p-4 h-auto\">\n            <blockquote class=\"group transition-all [&_p]:transition-all cursor-pointer hover:bg-ss-green hover:text-white/70 bg-white border border-[rgba(175, 175, 175, 0.4)] px-5 pt-20 pb-5 relative lg:text-base leading-6 rounded-xl h-full [&_p]:mb-3 shadow-lg flex flex-col\">\n              <ul class=\"inline-flex transition-all items-center gap-1 group-hover:bg-white bg-ss-green rounded-r-md p-[10px_15px_7px_20px] shadow-md absolute -left-4 top-6 text-primary after:w-0 after:h-0 after:absolute after:top-[-10px] after:left-0 after:-z-[1] after:border-t-[10px] after:border-t-transparent after:border-r-[20px] after:border-r-ss-green after:border-b-[10px] after:border-b-transparent group-hover:after:border-r-white group-hover:bg-ss-white\">\n                <li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n                <li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n                <li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n                <li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n                <li><i class=\"icon-star\"></i></li>\n              </ul>\n              <i class=\"icon-quote text-ss-green/15 text-[50px] absolute top-[69px] left-[10px] group-hover:text-primary/30\"></i>\n              <p>I had the best with Tanya Martinez. She is the best and so thoughtful and eager to help you succeed. She goes above her duty to help you and I wouldn't want to work with anyone but her. She gets 5 stars from me, if I could give more I would. Thanks Tanya for being there and helping me through these tough times. You're the best.</p>\n              <div class=\"group-hover:text-white text-ss-black transition-all flex flex-col justify-end flex-1\">\n                <cite class=\"block transition-all text-lg xl:text-xl font-lead font-bold not-italic\">Stacy Brumsey</cite>\n                <span class=\"group-hover:text-white text-ss-green transition-all\">Client</span>\n              </div>\n            </blockquote>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"max-sm:hidden top-[42%] swiper-button-prev after:content-none size-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-ss-black\">\n        <i class=\"text-white icon-chevron-left\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"max-sm:hidden top-[42%] swiper-button-next after:content-none size-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-ss-black\">\n        <i class=\"text-white icon-chevron-right\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"swiper-pagination flex justify-center items-center [&_.swiper-pagination-bullet]:bg-ss-black [&_.swiper-pagination-bullet]:opacity-100 [&_.swiper-pagination-bullet.swiper-pagination-bullet-active]:bg-transparent ...\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
